{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\">&quot;Yesterday never truly left.&quot;</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;A Man's Work&quot;</strong> is a short, story-driven psychological horror set in 2001. During a cold, snowy winter, Nikolay Sokolov, a rising Russian horror film actor, returns to his late father\u2019s apartment to sort through his belongings and memories. His father was a hardworking, quiet man who never spoke of the past, especially the tragedy that tore their family apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game\u2019s main genre is walking simulator.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An early-2000s inspired aesthetic.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The immersive sound design and atmospheric soundtrack draw you in, layering tension to the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Actions, decisions, and found recordings weave the story of a chilling supernatural past.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  </h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4015450?t=1764189075","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015450/a0909ca60242a56e2a0f80784db57ab8c0cc66c0/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1764189075","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015450/eee0cf5ad430d72e762644acc003c74126a9f6c4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764189075","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4015450/eee0cf5ad430d72e762644acc003c74126a9f6c4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764189075","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id